{"title":"Traditional Christmas","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cem\u003eTraditional Décor Curated Collection\u003c\/em\u003e from Carol's Christmas Conifers is perfect for those who want to embrace the timeless charm of a classic Christmas. Filled with beloved holiday staples like lush green artificial trees, classic ornaments, and warm lighting, this collection is designed to help you create a cozy and nostalgic holiday atmosphere. Whether you’re decorating your home for the first time or adding to a beloved family tradition, this collection has everything you need to capture the magic of the season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHandpicked Classic Christmas Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur team has thoughtfully curated this collection to reflect the charm and tradition of a classic Christmas. Choose from beautifully realistic artificial trees, traditional ornaments in reds and golds, and accessories that create a warm, inviting feel. The Traditional Décor Collection ensures that all your holiday decor aligns with a timeless, festive look that has been cherished for generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop Traditional Holiday Decor in One Place\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe understand the importance of keeping your holiday decor cohesive. That’s why we’ve gathered everything you need to complete your traditional Christmas theme in one place. No need to spend hours searching for the perfect pieces—our handpicked collection offers everything from trees to ornaments, ribbons, and more, making your holiday decorating as easy as it is joyful.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEffortless Setup, Timeless Charm\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur artificial Christmas trees are designed for both beauty and convenience. Choose from pre-lit or unlit trees, depending on your preference, and enjoy the easy setup that comes with our high-quality craftsmanship. These trees are meticulously crafted to bring the classic look of a natural Christmas tree into your home while providing years of festive enjoyment.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"15-pack-red-green-glass-ornament","title":"Mistletoe 15-Piece Glass Ornament Set (Red-Green)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Limited Edition Mistletoe Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 15 distinctly designed pieces offering a classic blend of red, green and gold; this beautiful set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036334792,"sku":"DHC3M8C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Mistletoecopy_1.png?v=1714674592"},{"product_id":"48-pack-red-green-shatterproof","title":"Red and Green Shatterproof Ornaments (48 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you have kids, cats, or simply want that extra peace of mind when hanging or storing your ornament collection, you can’t go wrong with the unmatched durability of a beautiful shatterproof set. Each Red and Green Shatterproof Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 48 shatterproof pieces offering a classic blend of gloss and matte reds \u0026amp; greens, this colorful set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that not only demands attention but also withstands any attacks from your furry friends or little ones!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036498632,"sku":"KWZ7N2V","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RedandGreenShatterproofOrnaments.png?v=1722012770"},{"product_id":"24-pack-burgundy-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Burgundy Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Burgundy Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss reds; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Green Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036695240,"sku":"ZGS7V7C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BurgundyEssentialOrnamentSet.png?v=1714662456"},{"product_id":"24-pack-green-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Green Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Green Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss greens; this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Burgundy Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack) or Red Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036728008,"sku":"FQF8K5L","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1010994copy_1.png?v=1714674759"},{"product_id":"24-pack-red-essential-glass-ornament","title":"Red Essential Glass Ornaments (24 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Red Essential Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 24 pieces offering a beautiful blend of matte and gloss reds, this gorgeous set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Green Essential Glass Ornament Set (24 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036760776,"sku":"JEG5S9C","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicRedRibbon_10Yards_79c1abb5-5538-4828-8ee0-e606c0b38ea3.png?v=1769702552"},{"product_id":"12-pack-gold-accents","title":"Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to holiday traditions, hanging the ornaments with your loved ones sparks some of the most memorable moments of the season. That means you can’t just settle for any ordinary ornaments. Each Gold Accents Glass Ornament Set is carefully handcrafted to complement the beauty of your Christmas tree and the memories that surround it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eWith 12 distinctively designed pieces offering an elegant blend of glamorous golds; this unique set gives you the perfect final touch for a centerpiece that demands attention and stands out from the rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e*Pairs perfectly with our Silver Accents Ornament Set (12 Pack).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946036793544,"sku":"JMF2K4E","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Untitleddesign_17.png?v=1771956501"},{"product_id":"red-thick-ribbon","title":"Classic Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCreating a memorable holiday atmosphere with\n\u003cbr\u003eyour loved ones is easy with the Classic Red\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon. This timeless ribbon is the perfect way to\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplement your decorations for an unforgettable\n\u003cbr\u003eChristmas, season after season. Accented with\n\u003cbr\u003eexquisite gold trim to create a timeless flair, this\n\u003cbr\u003etradition-worthy ribbon will add the perfect touch\n\u003cbr\u003eof elegance to your oasis.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037317832,"sku":"JGJ2C4J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicRedRibbon.png?v=1714662241"},{"product_id":"red-thin-ribbon","title":"Classic Thin Red Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eTalk about a timeless tradition that will never go\n\u003cbr\u003eout of style. Red ribbon has been a staple of every\n\u003cbr\u003eholiday oasis for decades. Our Classic Red Thin\n\u003cbr\u003eRibbon takes it to the next level, perfectly\n\u003cbr\u003ecomplementing your setting with a splash of red\n\u003cbr\u003ethat is accented with an elegant gold trim.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eClassic Red Thin Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037350600,"sku":"VEV5K8F","price":39.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/ClassicThinRedRibbon.png?v=1714662232"},{"product_id":"royal-green-ribbon","title":"Royal Green Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Royal Green Ribbon is a holiday must-have that\n\u003cbr\u003eadds a majestic touch to your Christmas décor. This\n\u003cbr\u003eelegant ribbon features unique gold accents that\n\u003cbr\u003ewill make your holiday oasis sparkle and shine\n\u003cbr\u003ebrighter than ever before while adding a timeless\n\u003cbr\u003etradition to your seasonal celebrations that will\n\u003cbr\u003ecreate warm memories for years to come.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eRoyal Green Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037383368,"sku":"LCV9S2E","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/1_0b9f2410-cdbe-4ce4-8695-49444202caa8.jpg?v=1718159242"},{"product_id":"gold-glitter-ribbon","title":"Gold Glitter Ribbon (10 Yards)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the spirit of the holidays into your home with\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Made\n\u003cbr\u003ewith sparkling glitter accents, this elegant gold\n\u003cbr\u003eribbon exudes a festive sheen and is perfect for\n\u003cbr\u003ethat traditional Christmas setting that will instill\n\u003cbr\u003ethe best memories season after season.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you’re putting the finishing touches on\n\u003cbr\u003eyour centerpiece, wrapping your wreaths,\n\u003cbr\u003eaccessorizing gift boxes, or seeking to add a quick\n\u003cbr\u003esplash of holiday magic to that space that needs\n\u003cbr\u003ejust a bit more love, a little ribbon can go a long\n\u003cbr\u003eway.\n\u003cbr\u003eWith a generous 10 yards in length, the decorating\n\u003cbr\u003epossibilities are truly endless. Let your creativity\n\u003cbr\u003erun wild and bring your Christmas dreams to life\n\u003cbr\u003ethis holiday season with a roll of the distinguished\n\u003cbr\u003eGold Glitter Ribbon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946037448904,"sku":"FNM3S2J","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/P1020184copy.png?v=1714674770"},{"product_id":"berry-pine-picks","title":"Berry and Pine Picks (12 Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of the holiday season to any room\n\u003cbr\u003ewith festive Berry and Pine Picks! These elegantly\n\u003cbr\u003ecrafted accents are highlighted by festive red\n\u003cbr\u003eberries and beautiful pine branches, creating a\n\u003cbr\u003etraditional and homey holiday atmosphere that\n\u003cbr\u003eradiates unmatched feelings of comfort and joy.\n\u003cbr\u003eWhether you want to add some extra flair to your\n\u003cbr\u003ecenterpiece or inject some dimension to your\n\u003cbr\u003ewreath, garland, or tabletop display, you can’t go\n\u003cbr\u003ewrong with a stylish set of elegant holiday picks.\n\u003cbr\u003eGrab a set of 12 Berry and Pine Picks for your space\n\u003cbr\u003etoday, and let your creativity run wild.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42946038005960,"sku":"TSX8P7B","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BerryandPinePicks_12Pack_bdb6921a-6fa0-4e05-8782-8488df80d70b.png?v=1714662133"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/ellenblisshome--jolly-elves--2022-11-17-09-50-04--instagram_copy.jpg?v=1760626071","url":"/\/collections\/traditional-decor.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}